      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCKING ROMA (1) jumps from the inside draw. Last start finished 4th in a Grade 5 on September 12 over 300m at this track behind Extreme Blue beaten 8 lengths (17.73). Looks hard to beat with even luck. BUGLE GIRL (7) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 5 lengths into second (17.48) at this track in a Grade 5 over 300m. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and nine minor placings to her credit. Ready to find winning form. ASTON PRESIDENT (8) should enjoy clear running from the outside box. Below best latest at this track (17.79) when 7th and beaten 8 lengths. Has a strong winning record here at this journey including six wins. Should be in this for a long way. SEMTEX (2) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
